+	depends on NVMEM
 	depends on THERMAL_OF
 	help
 	  If you say yes here you get read-only hwmon support for the
 	  CLN22ULP temperature converter in the ZTE ZX279133 SoC. The sensor
-	  is sampled on demand and exports a single temperature input. It does
-	  not expose threshold, alarm, or other writable controls.
+	  is calibrated from its required ttrim NVMEM cell, sampled on demand,
+	  and exports a single temperature input. It does not expose threshold,
+	  alarm, or other writable controls.
 
